{"id":786567,"title":"25｜FastGPT接入云端：Azure + ChatGLM","content":"上节课介绍了FastGPT的私有部署，但在国内网络环境下，直接使用OpenAI模型会遇到连接问题。为解决这一难题，本节课讲解如何通过OneAPM工具接入其他大模型，如ChatGLM和Azure OpenAI等。首先，在Clos平台的应用商店中找到并部署OneAPM应用。登录后，通过渠道功能添加新的模型接口，例如配置智谱ChetJLM和Azure OpenAI，需填写相应API密钥与地址。完成渠道设置后，创建令牌供前端FastGPT调用，并在安装FastGPT时将baseURL改为OneAPM服务端地址及对应密钥。最后，进入FastGPT应用管理界面修改配置文件中的llmmodels节点，更新模型名称以匹配新接入的大模型。经上述步骤，FastGPT即可成功对接多种大语言模型，实现跨平台、多源模型的灵活调用。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398605,"user_name":"DoHer4S","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2391667,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"A1D028355FAEB8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/7e/73/a5d76036.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741763016,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"不愧是你 百度！","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":397679,"user_name":"周大师","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1344002,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"48B13BFF2135AD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/82/02/32f451ae.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739280702,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"老师好，想请教一下您，本地化部署之后，后续模型版本升级应该如何实现，最小化影响之前的知识。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":397293,"user_name":"魏龙云","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1641662,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"7D6B5D9DA359A8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/0c/be/ee3e52cf.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737561908,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"我明白了，是不是公司级别业务部署本地大模型的时候，公司申请gpu服务器，然后本地先部署one-api，然后再添加各个模型到本地呗","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":397292,"user_name":"魏龙云","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1641662,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"7D6B5D9DA359A8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/0c/be/ee3e52cf.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737561452,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"老师我问下用这个云平台部署本地模型，如果想在公司本地部署用这个平台不行吧，比如涉及到订单信息的，那得用什么方式部署才行呢","like_count":0}]}